# gpu-nvidia: NVIDIA proprietary userspace with the open kernel modules via DKMS (needs contrib/non-free).
# WARNING: Debian 13 ships the 550 branch, which does not support RTX 50 (Blackwell) cards; those need
# driver 570+ from NVIDIA's own apt repository (see packages/README.md). x86-64 only.
# The installer never touches initramfs or the kernel command line.
nvidia-driver
nvidia-open-kernel-dkms
nvidia-settings
nvidia-vaapi-driver
libnvidia-egl-wayland1
dkms
linux-headers-amd64
